    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.why": "未經檢驗的吊裝設備或超期未保養的機械是停工和安全風險。提前標記能讓設備保持合規並正常運轉。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.register.in.hired": "租賃合約",
