    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.actions.what": "為會議產生的每一項行動建立一個任務,均指定責任人和截止日期。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.actions.why": "沒有責任人、沒有日期的行動項永遠無法完成。同時指定兩者,才能讓進度可追蹤、讓人可問責。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.in.agenda": "會議議程",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.in.attendees": "與會人員",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.out.decisions": "已記錄決定",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.out.minutes": "已記錄紀要",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.title": "主持會議並記錄紀要",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.what": "召開會議,按議程推進,並隨時記錄出席情況、紀要以及每項決定。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.agenda-minutes.why": "沒有書面記錄的會議,下週還會被重新爭論,而口頭決定在爭議中站不住腳。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.issue-minutes.in.actions": "未結行動項",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.issue-minutes.in.minutes": "已記錄紀要",
