    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.issue-minutes.out.issued": "已發出紀要",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.issue-minutes.title": "發出紀要和行動項",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.issue-minutes.what": "生成紀要和未結行動項清單,發送給所有與會人員。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.issue-minutes.why": "紀要只有在發出後才對各方具有約束力。分發行動項能閉環整個流程,併為每個截止日期啓動倒計時。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.rfi.in.minutes": "會議紀要",
