    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.deliver.out.attendance": "出席記錄",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.deliver.out.topic": "已記錄主題與日期",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.deliver.title": "宣講並記錄出席情況",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.deliver.what": "召集班組,進行交底,然後按主題和日期登記出席人員,確保當班每個人的名字都與其所接受的交底相對應。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.deliver.why": "出席記錄就是證據。若日後對某起事件展開調查,誰在什麼內容上接受過交底的記錄,既保護工人也保護現場。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.file.in.attendance": "出席記錄",
