    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.file.out.audit": "可審計的安全記錄",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.file.out.diary": "施工日誌條目",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.file.title": "將記錄歸檔到施工日誌",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.file.what": "將安全講話記入日誌,包括主題、在場班組和時間,與當天其他記錄一併歸檔。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.file.why": "只存在於個人記憶中的簡報,對其他人來說等於沒有發生過。歸入日誌記錄使其成為項目永久、可審計歷史的一部分。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.in.diary": "日誌記錄",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.in.gaps": "講話中提出的問題",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.out.action": "已分配的安全整改事項",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.out.closed": "在施工前已關閉的整改事項",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.title": "跟進任何整改事項",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.what": "如果講話中發現了缺失的管控措施、損壞的工具或設備缺口,將其立為整改事項並指定負責人和期限,並在施工開始前確認已關閉。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.follow-up.why": "講話中發現隱患卻不採取行動,比不講更糟,因為風險已被知曉卻無人管控。跟進整改事項才是真正保障班組安全的關鍵。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.in.hazards": "已知現場隱患",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.in.plan": "當日施工計劃",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.out.activity": "已選定的高風險作業",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.out.hazard": "已識別的主要隱患",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.title": "選定作業和隱患",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.what": "查看當天計劃的施工內容,選出風險最高的作業,並記下班組將面對的主要隱患,如高處作業、吊裝、動火作業、帶電設施,或當天最突出的風險。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.pick-activity.why": "只有緊扣當天班組眼前的實際工作,安全講話才有效果。結合真實作業和真實隱患,才能讓班組認真聽而不是敷衍點頭。",
    "cases.run_a_toolbox_talk_and_record_attendance.step.prepare.in.activity": "已選定的作業",
